<com:TContent ID="body">

<h1>TRepeater Sample 6</h1>

<p>
A repeater with paging turned on. The repeater renders one page of the bound data, and the
<tt>TPager</tt> below it moves between pages. <tt>DataKeyField</tt> collects the product id
of every row, so the select button reports the id without putting it in the markup.
</p>

<com:TRepeater ID="Repeater"
	AllowPaging="true"
	PageSize="5"
	DataKeyField="id"
	OnItemCommand="itemCommand">

<prop:HeaderTemplate>
<table cellpadding="4">
<tr style="color:white;background-color:black">
  <th>ID</th><th>Name</th><th>Quantity</th><th>Price</th><th></th>
</tr>
</prop:HeaderTemplate>

<prop:ItemTemplate>
<tr style="background-color:#BFCFFF">
<td><%#$this->Data['id']%></td>
<td><%#$this->Data['name']%></td>
<td><%#$this->Data['quantity']%></td>
<td>$<%#$this->Data['price']%></td>
<td><com:TLinkButton Text="Select" CommandName="select" /></td>
</tr>
</prop:ItemTemplate>

<prop:AlternatingItemTemplate>
<tr style="background-color:#E6ECFF">
<td><%#$this->Data['id']%></td>
<td><%#$this->Data['name']%></td>
<td><%#$this->Data['quantity']%></td>
<td>$<%#$this->Data['price']%></td>
<td><com:TLinkButton Text="Select" CommandName="select" /></td>
</tr>
</prop:AlternatingItemTemplate>

<prop:FooterTemplate>
<tr style="background-color:gray;color:white">
  <td colspan="5">Page <%# $this->Parent->CurrentPageIndex + 1 %> of <%# $this->Parent->PageCount %></td>
</tr>
</table>
</prop:FooterTemplate>

<prop:EmptyTemplate>
<p><em>No products to show.</em></p>
</prop:EmptyTemplate>

</com:TRepeater>

<div style="margin-top:8px">
Go to page:
<com:TPager ID="Pager"
	ControlToPaginate="Repeater"
	Mode="Numeric"
	OnPageIndexChanged="pageChanged" />
</div>

<p>
<com:TLabel ID="Result" Text="Nothing selected yet." />
</p>

<p>
The select handler rebinds the repeater before it returns. Without that, the repeater
would rebuild its rows from view state with no data behind them, and every cell would
render empty. <tt>CurrentPageIndex</tt> is held in view state, so rebinding shows the same
page again.
</p>

<p>
<com:TButton Text="Bind an empty list" OnClick="bindEmpty" />
<com:TButton Text="Bind the products again" OnClick="bindProducts" />
</p>

</com:TContent>
